sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant V as Voice HTTP
    participant S as Text WebSocket
    participant R as Reviewed retrieval
    participant D as SQLite
    participant Q as Analysis worker
    opt Voice input
      B->>V: Validated WAV and language hint
      V-->>B: Transcript or typed recovery
    end
    B->>S: Question
    S->>R: Find an approved card
    R-->>S: Exact answer and citation or abstention
    S-->>B: Sentence and cited reply
    opt Voice playback
      B->>V: Synthesize approved sentence if needed
      V-->>B: Audio or browser fallback
    end
    B->>S: Contact, demo request and explicit confirmation
    S->>D: Claim unique slot
    D-->>S: Committed booking or conflict
    S-->>B: Receipt
    S--)Q: Completed turns and finalization
    Q->>D: Save validated call report
